docs {
  # payments:simulateVerification (MUTATION)
  
  Simulasikan verifikasi admin (Approve -> Lunas & Pop-up Success / Reject)
  
  Saat `decision: 'approve'`, mengubah status `payment` dan `booking` menjadi `paid` sehingga memicu Pop-up Success di layar pembayaran.
  
  ## Parameter (`args`)
  - `bookingId` (string, Wajib): ID booking
  - `decision` ("approve" | "reject", Wajib): Keputusan verifikasi (approve = lunas, reject = tolak)
  
  ## Pemanggilan di React (Convex Hook)
  ```ts
  const verifyPay = useMutation(api.payments.simulateVerification);
  await verifyPay({ bookingId: "bk-example", decision: "approve" });
  ```
}
